WEBVTT

00:06:58.172 --> 00:07:00.995
I didn't have to wait that long
to find an answer.

00:07:01.392 --> 00:07:04.149
Six months after that first visit,

00:07:04.173 --> 00:07:06.533
he invited me back to New York.

00:07:07.371 --> 00:07:09.324
JW: The designers of the Brooklyn Bridge,

00:07:09.348 --> 00:07:10.954
they had their share of bad luck.

00:07:11.460 --> 00:07:14.890
John Roebling, he died shortly after
the bridge's construction began.

00:07:14.914 --> 00:07:16.303
His son Washington took over,

00:07:16.327 --> 00:07:18.654
but he suffered
from decompression sickness.

00:07:18.678 --> 00:07:21.680
His wife Emily became the surrogate
executive engineer

00:07:21.704 --> 00:07:23.672
who oversaw the bridge's completion.

00:07:24.227 --> 00:07:25.700
Father and son,

00:07:25.724 --> 00:07:27.424
John and Washington,

00:07:27.448 --> 00:07:29.145
done in by their work.

00:07:29.672 --> 00:07:31.194
It was this sunny day in May